### Lecturas

# Listar lecturas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lecturas

### Obtener lectura por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lecturas/1

### Crear lectura
POST http://localhost:3000/api/lecturas
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El Quijote",
  "autor": "Miguel de Cervantes",
  "fechaPublicacion": "1605-01-16",
  "editorial": "Francisco de Robles",
  "disponible": true,
  "categoriaId": 1
}

### Actualizar lectura
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/lecturas/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El Quijote (Edición Revisada)",
  "disponible": false
}

### Eliminar lectura
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/lecturas/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>